1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,345
Every driver
passing you

2
00:00:01,345 --> 00:00:03,595
sneezes the
instant you do.

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,640
For a split
second,

4
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,110
almost every human
eye is shut.

5
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:10,750
Millions of
cars roll

6
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:12,310
a few meters
blind.

7
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:14,100
Only a dog
watches.

8
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,440
Mostly, nothing
happens.

9
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,520
Drivers
sneeze at

10
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,170
the wheel
every day.

11
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:21,260
But you don't
hear it at once:

12
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:22,870
your street
first,

13
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:24,520
then the
city, fading.

14
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,720
One sneeze can
spray tens

15
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,580
of thousands
of droplets.

16
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,440
Together,

17
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,690
that could top
300 trillion.

18
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,380
That's
probably a

19
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,160
normal day
of sneezing,

20
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,910
crammed into
one second.

21
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:38,330
So for once,

22
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:39,570
there's
nobody left

23
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,450
to say
bless you.

24
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,080
Except the dog.
